        "protocol_version": "chronicle-artifact-influence-ledger/v1",
        "claim_boundary": "Exact raw/support artifact percolation for the recorded product plan, implementation, deterministic synthetic corpora, and intervention catalog. Each intervention changes exactly one source artifact; every warm query and query-group checkpoint plus every researcher-visible output is compared with an independent cold Rust/WASM target. Absence of an effect is not generalized beyond the named mutation and corpus."
      },
      {
        "path": "web/src/lib/pipelineGraph/golden/family-expected/raw-boundary-influence-ledger.json",
